Fish: custom payloads of players in the server's play phase (P7). `lan_guest_packet` has an opaque
macro, so no horizon-mixins hook can sit inside it, and it drops `CustomPayload` (except the quiet
commands channel) in its match. The new arm calls the bundle's `fish_bridge::net::server_play` (so
this patch needs the bundle applied).

